<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan cotton output to June 1 below year-ago.</title>
<headline>Pakistan cotton output to June 1 below year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Cotton Ginners Association said on Thursday 1996/97 (July-June) cotton output had reached a provisional 8.78 million 375-lb bales by June 1, down from 9.938 million at the same time a year ago. --Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
